>> Error in doGRASS(cmd, flags = flags, parameters = parameters) :
>>   Parameter <band> does not have integer value
>
> You specified band="1" , which is a character - try band=1

Right, "1" is a character vector of one element. To disambiguate, band 
must be an integer, and 1 will possibly be treated as a numeric, so 
band=1L or band=as.integer(1) ought to be used. Looking at the output of 
parseGRASS() tells you what type the parameter values should be.

Roger

